==============================================================================================================
  [FAIL] R3 ratio strictly decreasing outward AND crossing 1 between n = 1e12 and the photosphere, for all 12 (M, n) cases
         measured: 0/12
         reading:  a g = a0(rho) surface exists inside EVERY such envelope for every allowed parameter -- its existence is not a finding

