R4 -- CHANCE PROBABILITY AND THE HONEST ERROR BAR
==============================================================================================================
   envelope 10-941 au; P(crossing within x2 of r_B | log-uniform) = 0.31
   propagated from the campaign's own input ranges: log10(g_B/a0) = 0.00 +/- 0.47 dex (ratio x/÷ 2.9)
  [PASS] R4 the coincidence is NOT significant: P(chance) > 0.05 and the ratio's honest error bar exceeds 0.2 dex
         measured: P = 0.31; sd = 0.47 dex (the paper quotes +/- 0.02, i.e. 0.009 dex)
         reading:  '1.001 +/- 0.02' is the precision of round inputs, not of a measurement; one named layer in a 2-dex envelope catches a guaranteed crossing ~1/3 of the time

