==============================================================================================================
   canonical: g_B/a0 = 6.34e+07   g_phot/a0 = 6.74e+05   r_M = 3.86 pc (photosphere ~ 0.0046 pc)
   alt      : g_B/a0 = 5.26e+07   g_phot/a0 = 5.59e+05   r_M = 3.52 pc (photosphere ~ 0.0046 pc)
  [PASS] R6 g/a0_flat >= 1e5 at the Balmer layer and the photosphere, both footings
         measured: min = 5.59e+05
         reading:  on its own terms the framework predicts NO a0 signature in any BH* envelope (a null, consistent with CFJC Thm 3's 1e-6 a0-blindness of the mass chain); the only BH* object with an a0 lever is the naked-BH host (L324)

